# Normalise line endings. This is not housekeeping: on 2026-09-25 a concurrent
# rewrite left 20 agent files with CRLF endings, and the static eval's
# frontmatter regex silently matched nothing on every one of them — in
# JavaScript, `\r` is a line terminator, so `name:` parsed as absent and a whole
# class of checks passed by doing nothing. Text is LF in the repo, whatever the
# checkout platform does locally.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
